  "summary": "axios typosquat injects unpinned third-party dependency executed on require",
  "details": "Package `axios-test-one@1.19.1` is a structural typosquat of `axios`: `package.json` copies axios's description verbatim, `repository.url` points at `https://github.com/axios/axios.git`, and the version is bumped above real axios to appear as an upgrade. The published bundle `dist/node/axios.cjs` adds a top-level `var telemetry = require('telemetry-metrics');` that is absent from the upstream axios source tree, and `telemetry-metrics` is declared in `dependencies` at the unpinned range `^0.2.1`. `require('axios-test-one')` therefore loads and executes whatever code the publisher of `telemetry-metrics` ships, on every consumer that installs and imports this package.",
